		{
			dependencies: ["AAA52F860649A08B"]
			description: [
				"This world uses &6Epic Fight&r. Press &eR&r to switch between Mining Mode and &cBattle Mode&r."
				""
				"In Battle Mode your attacks become combos, and you already know two skills:"
				"&b- Roll&r: dodge through an attack (it costs stamina - the blue bar)."
				"&b- Guard&r: hold your guard key with a weapon out to block."
				""
				"Lock onto a target with the lock-on key. Every key is listed under &eOptions > Controls > Epic Fight&r - rebind anything that feels wrong."
				""
				"Go practise on something that deserves it."
			]
